00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:07,540
He was a pastor,

388
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:09,439
I can't remember what else about him.

389
00:22:10,220 --> 00:22:13,199
And, uh, they were halfway down the river and they were camped out

