00:22:58,840 --> 00:23:05,640
And this pastor who, who was a pretty decent rafter but had nowhere near that experience,

404
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,020
chose to stay put?

405
00:23:07,020 --> 00:23:12,260
And that's, that's one of the key things to survival.

406
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:19,580
There's, there's, uh, when I was a forester out in Oregon, I was a dumb kid, just 21 years

407
00:23:19,580 --> 00:23:19,900
old,

