00:23:20,420 --> 00:23:22,280
And uh, this is Western Oregon

409
00:23:22,280 --> 00:23:28,940
And if you step off the path in Western Oregon, you're in rhododendron and Douglas fir trees

410
00:23:28,940 --> 00:23:32,320
And I mean, they turn you around. you'll never find your way out.

411
00:23:32,379 --> 00:23:36,740
I was putting in a timber sale or changing a timber sale, and that you were supposed to change

412
00:23:36,740 --> 00:23:37,880
it by ribboning. in

413
00:23:38,020 --> 00:23:41,800
You, you would walk in and you had this uh, this, uh yellow flagging that you would put

414
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:45,540
on the to put on the trees that would show where the boundaries of the timber sale is.

