00:23:53,660 --> 00:23:54,060
Right,

418
00:23:54,060 --> 00:23:55,440
I didn't do that.

419
00:23:56,020 --> 00:24:01,000
I started at the beginning, started pulling off ribbons and pretty soon I was in. I was

