00:25:15,220 --> 00:25:17,740
If you got lost. you were lost.

442
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:23,240
I mean, you better be able to figure out where you were with a map and a compass. uh, because

443
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,920
you couldn't call anybody.

444
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:30,080
Then they came out with the satellite phone, which has totally changed the nature of wilderness

445
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:30,600
travel.

446
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:33,880
Now, in some respects it's made things safer

