00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:36,920
And in other respects it's made it way less safe.

448
00:25:37,100 --> 00:25:42,800
You can depend on your gear to a point, but if you don't have the skills and the judgment,

449
00:25:44,080 --> 00:25:46,820
there's the gears. just so much dead weight, isn't it?

450
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:47,500
Yeah

