00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:49,980
Well, you know, here's another factor we could add into this.

452
00:25:50,220 --> 00:25:52,820
I call this downplay: your skills.

453
00:25:52,820 --> 00:26:00,720
I guess what I'm saying is my skills of paddling these rapids are way better than I'm willing

454
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:01,659
to accept.

455
00:26:02,300 --> 00:26:11,620
Um, I may be a class three, four whitewater capable paddler, but if it gets into low class

