00:26:11,620 --> 00:26:16,980
three, I want to either portage or wine or find some safe way around it.

457
00:26:16,980 --> 00:26:20,960
So a judgment is you know, judgment is really important.

458
00:26:21,060 --> 00:26:22,940
It takes a long time to develop judgment.

459
00:26:23,080 --> 00:26:24,880
You're not going to do that in one or two seasons.

